  swc_create_object l_wa_actdisdoc 'DISCONNECT' l_disdocno.
*  ENDIF.
  swc_call_method l_wa_actdisdoc 'CreateFromdata' t_container.

* If the method execution failed
  IF sy-subrc NE 0.
* display messsage: Could not create disconnection document
    MESSAGE s008(zcse).
    EXIT.
  ENDIF.

  swc_get_object_key l_wa_actdisdoc l_key.
  REFRESH: t_container.
*set the disconnection key into the container.
  swc_set_element t_container 'DISCONNECT' l_wa_actdisdoc.

