* If the method execution failed
  IF sy-subrc NE 0.
* DISPLAY MESSAGE: Could not create disconnection order
    MESSAGE s009(zcse).
    EXIT.
  ENDIF.
*Obtaining the order number returned by the method
  swc_get_element t_container 'Order' l_ordernum.
*Instantiating the service order object with the order number.
  swc_create_object l_wa_isusmorder 'ISUSMORDER' l_ordernum.
* get the service order object
  swc_get_table t_container   'ISUSMORDER' lt_isusmorder.
* append the order to the service order object
  APPEND l_wa_isusmorder TO t_isusmorder.
* set back the order back to container
* swc_set_table  t_container 'ISUSMORDER' lt_isusmorder.

